 curious, and evil. If you get to know him as well as he'll get to know you, you might find a way out. Or maybe you'll prefer to stay?\r\n\r\nIn this choose-your-own-adventure, every choice matters. Strade will get to know you and your personality through your actions, and it may affect your outcome. There are 21 endings, but even a single ending may play out a bit differently depending on your choices. You will die, of course. But dying isn't the end- earn death tokens to unlock hints, walkthroughs, or bonus content. Maybe you'll even find a way to survive","description_language":"Bangumi 原文","sources":{"description":{"source":"bangumi_exact_title_or_alias","source_url":"https://bgm.tv/subject/622878","matched_name":"YKMET: Strade","checked_at":"2026-10-14T05:51:09+00:00"},"description_language":{"source":"bangumi_exact_title_or_alias","source_url":"https://bgm.tv/subject/622878","matched_name":"YKMET: Strade","checked_at":"2026-10-14T05:51:09+00:00"},"developers":{"source":"bangumi_exact_title_or_alias","source_url":"https://bgm.tv/subject/622878","matched_name":"YKMET: Strade","checked_at":"2026-10-14T05:51:09+00:00"},"publishers":{"source":"bangumi_exact_title_or_alias","source_url":"https://bgm.tv/subject/622878","matched_name":"YKMET: Strade","checked_at":"2026-10-14T05:51:09+00:00"},"tags":{"source":"bangumi_exact_title_or_alias","source_url":"https://bgm.tv/subject/622878","matched_name":"YKMET: Strade","checked_at":"2026-10-14T05:51:09+00:00"}},"developers":["Gatobob"],"publishers":["Gatobob"],"tags":["欧美","VN"]},"metadata_sources":{"name_zh":{"source":"bilibili_index_translate","machine_translated":true,"model":"Index-Translate-35B-A3B","source_url":"https://index-translate.bilibili.com","source_name":"YKMET: Strade","translated_title":"YKMET：街道","checked_at":"2026-10-15T01:58:36.425522+00:00"}},"availability":"available","missing_scans":0},{"id":"playzip:2468","source_id":"2468","source_url":"https://playzip.com/game/2468","name":"Thrive: Heavy Lies The C